  {% set yesimPrimary = providerB.codes | findCode(providerB.primaryCode) %}

  <div class="content-callout">
    <h2>The Short Answer</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Instabridge</strong> is the cheaper option in every destination we checked, and it bundles in a free WiFi hotspot database on top of the eSIM. <strong>Yesim</strong> costs more across the board, but its Pay &amp; Fly balance rolls over between trips instead of expiring, and it backs purchases with an actual 30-day refund guarantee. The gap isn't close on price, so Yesim only makes sense if you specifically want one of those two things Instabridge doesn't offer.
    </p>
  </div>

